<title>UK: Airtours year pretax profit soars 46.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Airtours year pretax profit soars 46.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		45.63		  vs 32.76</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 16.0		   vs 14.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     86.8		   vs 59.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   1.718 billion	vs 1.318 billion</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 72 and 82 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Airtours Plc</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
